ect_cf\"></div><canvas class=\"project_drag_cs_cvs circAn\"></canvas><div class=\"project_drag_cs_trl\"><svg width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 16\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M8.5 1.5L2 8L8.5 14.5\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"2\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"project_drag_cs_trd\"><svg width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 16\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M1.5 1.5L8 8L1.5 14.5\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"2\"></path></svg></div></div><div class=\"project_hero ssc\"><div class=\"project_hero_title\"><h1><span>如在其上 如在其下</span></h1></div><div class=\"project_hero_img\"> <div class=\"project_hero_line\"></div><div class=\"project_hero_header mini_header\"> <div class=\"project_hero_header_section_nbr\"> <span class=\"project_hero_header_rv header_nbr\">01/ </span></div><div class=\"project_hero_header_specs\"> <span class=\"project_hero_header_rv\">PRODUCT DESIGN + WEB DESIGN</span></div></div><div class=\"img_overlay\"></div><img class=\"project_hero_img_media project_gl lazy\" data-lazy src=\"/blank.png\" data-touch=\"/assets/curatorial-main-visual.jpg?v=14378ed0bd3e\" data-src=\"/assets/curatorial-main-visual.jpg?v=14378ed0bd3e\" alt=\"如在其上 如在其下策展主视觉\" width=\"2480\" height=\"3508\"></div><div class=\"project_hero_description\"> <h2>AS ABOVE.<br>SO BELOW</h2></div><div class=\"project_hero_roles_title\"> <span>SKILLS USED</span></div><div class=\"project_hero_roles\"> <p class=\"project_hero_roles_p\">Art Direction<br>Product Design<br>System Design<br>Interactive Design</p></div></div><div class=\"project_description ssc\"><div class=\"project_description_header mini_header\"><div class=\"project_description_header_section_nbr project_description_header_ov header_nbr\"><span class=\"project_description_header_rv\">02/</span></div><div class=\"project_description_header_title project_description_header_ov\"><span class=\"project_description_header_rv\">overview</span></div></div><div class=\"project_description_line\"></div><div class=\"home_about_glLineP\"> <div class=\"glLineP\"></div></div><div class=\"project_description_challenge\"><div class=\"project_description_challenge_title\"><h3><span class=\"project_description_title_rv\">项目介绍</span></h3></div><div class=\"project_description_challenge_d\" lang=\"zh-CN\"><p>《如在其上，如在其下》以宏观宇宙与内在心灵的对应关系为线索，汇集8位艺术家的摄影、影像与装置作品，通过沉浸式光影与空间叙事，探讨人、自然与技术的矛盾及共生，唤醒观众的感知力与共生意识</p></div></div></div><div class=\"project_row ssc\"><div class=\"project_row_header mini_header\"><div class=\"home_about_glLineP\"><div class=\"glLineP\"></div></div><div class=\"project_row_header_section_nbr header_nbr\">03/</div><div class=\"project_row_header_title\">共生法则</div></div></div><div class=\"project_row ssc\"><div class=\"project_row_inBetween_text curatorial-chapter-introduction\" lang=\"zh-CN\"><p class=\"project_row_inBetween_tile\">共生法则</p><div class=\"curatorial-chapter-copy\"><p class=\"project_row_inBetween_description\">赵仁辉以摄影作品《盲》与影像装置《试着记住一条河》，呈现人类观察和改造自然的痕迹。从隐身观察的悖论到河流生态的重生，引导观众在凝视与聆听中，反思人类与自然的共生关系。</p><figure class=\"curatorial-chapter-venue\"><img src=\"/assets/curatorial-symbiosis-venue.png?v=38258abc8d10\" width=\"591\" height=\"487\" alt=\"共生法则展览场地模型\" decoding=\"async\"></figure></div></div></div><div class=\"project_row ssc\"><div class=\"project_row_hero_media curatorial-chapter-media\"><img src=\"/assets/curatorial-symbiosis.gif?v=70fdc4ae8f4d\" width=\"3840\" height=\"2160\" alt=\"共生法则展览空间动态展示\" decoding=\"async\"></div></div><div class=\"project_row ssc\"><div class=\"project_row_header mini_header\"><div class=\"home_about_glLineP\"><div class=\"glLineP\"></div></div><div class=\"project_row_header_section_nbr header_nbr\">04/</div><div class=\"project_row_header_title\">形而上下</div></div></div><div class=\"project_row ssc\"><div class=\"project_row_inBetween_text curatorial-chapter-introduction\" lang=\"zh-CN\"><p class=\"project_row_inBetween_tile\">形而上下</p><div class=\"curatorial-chapter-copy\"><p class=\"project_row_inBetween_description\">唐征维、奥托·伯尔与付小桐通过剪纸、悬浮钢构和针刺宣纸，探索无形之力、空间张力与自然感知，将城市演化、重力平衡和山水记忆相连，呈现宏观世界与内在经验、可见与不可见之间的对应关系。</p><figure class=\"curatorial-chapter-venue\"><img src=\"/assets/curatorial-metaphysics-venue.png?v=62497dfaae28\" width=\"3840\" height=\"2160\" alt=\"形而上下展览场地模型\" decoding=\"async\"></figure></div></div></div><div class=\"project_row ssc\"><div class=\"project_row_hero_media curatorial-chapter-media curatorial-chapter-media--sequence\"><img src=\"/assets/curatorial-metaphysics-1.gif?v=4e7d0333da8e\" width=\"3840\" height=\"2160\" alt=\"形而上下剪纸作品展区动态展示\" decoding=\"async\"></div></div><div class=\"project_row ssc\"><div class=\"project_row_hero_media curatorial-chapter-media curatorial-chapter-media--sequence\"><img src=\"/assets/curatorial-metaphysics-2.gif?v=b08fcb7690cb\" width=\"3840\" height=\"2160\" alt=\"形而上下悬浮钢构作品展区动态展示\" decoding=\"async\"></div></div><div class=\"project_row ssc\"><div class=\"project_row_hero_media curatorial-chapter-media\"><img src=\"/assets/curatorial-metaphysics-3.gif?v=ca93467562ca\" width=\"3840\" height=\"2160\" alt=\"形而上下针刺宣纸作品展区动态展示\" decoding=\"async\"></div></div><div class=\"project_row ssc\"><div class=\"project_row_header mini_header\"><div class=\"home_about_glLineP\"><div class=\"glLineP\"></div></div><div class=\"project_row_header_section_nbr header_nbr\">05/</div><div class=\"project_row_header_title\">宇宙回响</div></div></div><div class=\"project_row ssc\"><div class=\"project_row_inBetween_text curatorial-chapter-introduction\" lang=\"zh-CN\"><p class=\"project_row_inBetween_tile\">宇宙回响</p><div class=\"curatorial-chapter-copy\"><p class=\"project_row_inBetween_description\">从鸟群迁徙、极地星图到海上劳作，《鸟类学》《恒星轴》与《利维坦》以摄影、装置和影像揭示自然秩序，引导观众在凝视与聆听中，感知人类、自然与技术的相互作用，体会个体与宇宙的共鸣。</p><figure class=\"curatorial-chapter-venue\"><img src=\"/assets/curatorial-cosmic-echoes-venue.png?v=00d5ca6362f7\" width=\"634\" height=\"431\" alt=\"宇宙回响展览场地模型\" decoding=\"async\"></figure></div></div></div><div class=\"project_row ssc\"><div class=\"project_row_hero_media curatorial-chapter-media curatorial-chapter-media--sequence\"><img src=\"/assets/curatorial-cosmic-echoes-1.gif?v=9aaa5d4a0063\" width=\"3840\" height=\"2160\" alt=\"宇宙回响鸟群轨迹展区动态展示\" decoding=\"async\"></div></div><div class=\"project_row ssc\"><div class=\"project_row_hero_media curatorial-chapter-media curatorial-chapter-media--sequence\"><img src=\"/assets/curatorial-cosmic-echoes-2.gif?v=8b5622d53a94\" width=\"3840\" height=\"2160\" alt=\"宇宙回响恒星轴展区动态展示\" decoding=\"async\"></div></div><div class=\"project_row ssc\"><div class=\"project_row_hero_media curatorial-chapter-media\"><video src=\"/assets/curatorial-cosmic-echoes-3.mp4?v=4dca63c2257a\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" autoplay muted loop playsinline webkit-playsinline preload=\"metadata\" controlslist=\"nofullscreen nodownload noremoteplayback\" disablepictureinpicture disableremoteplayback aria-label=\"宇宙回响利维坦影像展区动态展示\"></video></div></div><div class=\"project_row ssc\"><div class=\"project_row_header mini_header\"><div class=\"home_about_glLineP\"><div class=\"glLineP\"></div></div><div class=\"project_row_header_section_nbr header_nbr\">06/</div><div class=\"project_row_header_title\">宇宙回响</div></div></div><div class=\"project_row ssc\"><div class=\"project_row_inBetween_text curatorial-chapter-introduction\" lang=\"zh-CN\"><p class=\"project_row_inBetween_tile\">宇宙回响</p><div class=\"curatorial-chapter-copy\"><p class=\"project_row_inBetween_description\">《Verge》融合激光、数字LED、机器人技术与悬浮微粒，以沉浸式投影营造感官之旅。光影与粒子交织，唤醒难以言说的直觉，引导观众探索熟悉与未知的交汇处，体会感知边界的流动与变化。</p><figure class=\"curatorial-chapter-venue\"><img src=\"/assets/curatorial-verge-venue.png?v=9a24c32f5de7\" width=\"365\" height=\"611\" alt=\"Verge 展览场地模型\" decoding=\"async\"></figure></div></div></div><div class=\"project_row ssc\"><div class=\"project_row_hero_media curatorial-chapter-media\"><img src=\"/assets/curatorial-verge.gif?v=e3716078f29a\" width=\"3840\" height=\"2160\" alt=\"Verge 沉浸式光影空间动态展示\" decoding=\"async\"></div></div><div class=\"footer ssc\"><div class=\"footer_c\"><div class=\"footer_sen\"></div><nav class=\"footer_nav\"> <ul class=\"footer_nav_items\"></ul></nav></div></div><div class=\"footer--touch ssc\"> <nav class=\"footer_nav--touch\"><ul class=\"footer_nav_items--touch\"> </ul></nav></div><div class=\"projects_project_ref\"></div></div>","meta":"如在其上 如在其下"},"/kapsul":{"html":"<div class=\"project star-helm-project\"><div class=\"project_drag_cs\"><div class=\"project_cf\"></div><canvas class=\"project_drag_cs_cvs circAn\"></canvas><div class=\"project_drag_cs_trl\"><svg width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 16\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M8.5 1.5L2 8L8.5 14.5\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"2\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"project_drag_cs_trd\"><svg width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 16\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M1.5 1.5L8 8L1.5 14.5\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"2\"></path></svg></div></div><div class=\"project_hero ssc\"><div class=\"project_hero_title\"><h1><span>星舵 Star Helm</span></h1></div><div class=\"project_hero_img\"> <div class=\"project_hero_line\"></div><div class=\"project_hero_header mini_header\"> <div class=\"project_hero_header_section_nbr\"> <span class=\"project_hero_header_rv header_nbr\">01/ </span></div><div class=\"project_hero_header_specs\"> <span class=\"project_hero_header_rv\">POSTER</span></div></div><div class=\"img_overlay\"></div><img class=\"project_hero_img_media project_gl lazy\" data-lazy src=\"/blank.png\" data-touch=\"/assets/ar-game-work-card-cover-edgefill.png\" data-src=\"/assets/ar-game-work-card-cover-edgefill.png\" alt=\"Project Image\"></div><div class=\"project_hero_roles_title\"> <span>SKILLS USED</span></div><div class=\"project_hero_roles\"> <p class=\"project_hero_roles_p\">Web Design<br>3D Renders<br>Interactive Design<br>Motion design</p></div></div><div class=\"project_description star-helm-video-section ssc\"><div class=\"project_description_header mini_header\"><div class=\"project_description_header_section_nbr header_nbr\">02/</div><div class=\"project_description_header_title\">VIDEO</div></div><div class=\"home_about_glLineP\"><div class=\"glLineP\"></div></div><div class=\"star-helm-video-media\"><video class=\"star-helm-video\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\" controls playsinline preload=\"metadata\" aria-label=\"星舵 Star Helm AR 游戏演示视频\"><source src=\"/assets/star-helm-ar.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></div><section class=\"star-helm-chapter ssc\" aria-labelledby=\"star-helm-section-3\" data-pdf-pages=\"3,4,7,27\"><div class=\"star-helm-inner\"><div class=\"star-helm-section-header mini_header\"><span class=\"header_nbr\">03/</span><span id=\"star-helm-section-3\">项目概览</span></div><div class=\"star-helm-intro\"><h2>以手势为舵，<br>驶向心中的星辰。</h2><p>《星舵 Star Helm》是一款基于 Rokid AR Max Pro 的宇宙探索游戏。玩家以自然手势操控飞船，利用引力与斥力穿越障碍、收集星币，在真实空间中探索不同主题的星球。</p></div><dl class=\"star-helm-facts\"><div><dt>体验目标</dt><dd>低门槛、高趣味<br>直觉交互与空间探索</dd></div><div><dt>我的职责 / 张玳源</dt><dd>核心玩法脚本架构<br>3D 建模、美术制作与交互逻辑实现</dd></div><div><dt>项目平台</dt><dd>Rokid AR Max Pro<br>Unity · Rokid UXR SDK</dd></div></dl><figure class=\"star-helm-figure \"><img class=\"\" src=\"/assets/star-helm-world.webp?v=29a53330a204\" width=\"2400\" height=\"1350\" alt=\"星舵 Star Helm 游戏主视觉\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption>STAR HELM / 沉浸式宇宙探索</figcaption></figure></div></section><section class=\"star-helm-chapter ssc\" aria-labelledby=\"star-helm-section-4\" data-pdf-pages=\"8,9,22\"><div class=\"star-helm-inner\"><div class=\"star-helm-section-header mini_header\"><span class=\"header_nbr\">04/</span><span id=\"star-helm-section-4\">核心玩法与手势交互</span></div><div class=\"star-helm-intro\"><h2>一套手势，<br>两种力场。</h2><p>以托举、牵引和捏合连接玩家与飞船。通过黑洞的引力吸附与白洞的斥力击退调整航向，让同一套交互规则延展为不同关卡中的探索与挑战。</p></div><div class=\"star-helm-grid star-helm-grid--two\"><article><figure class=\"star-helm-figure \"><img class=\"\" src=\"/assets/star-helm-gesture-palm.webp\" width=\"1400\" height=\"779\" alt=\"托举和牵引飞船的手势交互画面\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></figure><h3>Palm / 托举与牵引</h3><p>用手掌承托、移动飞船，建立直观的操控关系，为启航选择方向。</p></article><article><figure class=\"star-helm-figure \"><img class=\"\" src=\"/assets/star-helm-gesture-pinch.webp\" width=\"1400\" height=\"773\" alt=\"捏合手势与双力场交互画面\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></figure><h3>Pinch / 发射与力场</h3><p>通过捏合发射飞船，并动态生成黑洞与白洞，利用引力和斥力修正飞行路线。</p></article></div></div></section><section class=\"star-helm-chapter ssc\" aria-labelledby=\"star-helm-section-5\" data-pdf-pages=\"10,11,12\"><div class=\"star-helm-inner\"><div class=\"star-helm-section-header mini_header\"><span class=\"header_nbr\">05/</span><span id=\"star-helm-section-5\">星球与关卡设计</span></div><div class=\"star-helm-intro\"><h2>不同的星球，<br>连贯的探索。</h2><p>以糖果、沙漠和海洋构建三个主题关卡。保持核心手势规则一致，通过场景、障碍与航线的变化形成不同的视觉情绪和游玩节奏。</p></div><div class=\"star-helm-grid star-helm-grid--three star-helm-planets\"><article><figure class=\"star-helm-figure \"><img class=\"\" src=\"/assets/star-helm-planet-candy.webp\" width=\"601\" height=\"565\" alt=\"糖果星球三维模型\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></figure><h3>糖果星球</h3><span class=\"star-helm-english\">Candy Planet</span><p>甜蜜、轻快的探索起点。</p></article><article><figure class=\"star-helm-figure \"><img class=\"\" src=\"/assets/star-helm-planet-desert.webp\" width=\"1000\" height=\"1000\" alt=\"沙之星球三维模型\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></figure><h3>沙之星球</h3><span class=\"star-helm-english\">Desert Planet</span><p>在沙地与遗迹之间不断修正航向。</p></article><article><figure class=\"star-helm-figure \"><img class=\"\" src=\"/assets/star-helm-planet-ocean.webp\" width=\"1000\" height=\"1000\" alt=\"海之星球三维模型\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></figure><h3>海之星球</h3><span class=\"star-helm-english\">Ocean Planet</span><p>在流动的海洋意象中寻找前进的路线。</p></article></div><div class=\"star-helm-routes\"><h3>三个关卡的通关路线</h3><figure class=\"star-helm-figure \"><img class=\"\" src=\"/assets/star-helm-route-candy.webp\" width=\"2400\" height=\"629\" alt=\"糖果星球的起点、障碍物、星币与终点路线图\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption>糖果星球 / Candy Planet</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"star-helm-figure \"><img class=\"\" src=\"/assets/star-helm-route-desert.webp\" width=\"2400\" height=\"534\" alt=\"沙之星球的起点、障碍物、星币与终点路线图\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption>沙之星球 / Desert Planet</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"star-helm-figure \"><img class=\"\" src=\"/assets/star-helm-route-ocean.webp\" width=\"2400\" height=\"572\" alt=\"海之星球的起点、障碍物、星币与终点路线图\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption>海之星球 / Ocean Planet</figcaption></figure></div></div></section><section class=\"star-helm-chapter ssc\" aria-labelledby=\"star-helm-section-6\" data-pdf-pages=\"13,21\"><div class=\"star-helm-inner\"><div class=\"star-helm-section-header mini_header\"><span class=\"header_nbr\">06/</span><span id=\"star-helm-section-6\">3D 资产搭建</span></div><div class=\"star-helm-intro\"><h2>从飞船到星币，<br>构建探索的世界。</h2><p>围绕飞船、星币和主题障碍物搭建三维资产。使用 Blender 完成模型与细节制作，让道具的形态、场景风格和交互反馈共同支撑游戏体验。</p></div><div class=\"star-helm-grid star-helm-grid--two star-helm-models\"><div><h3>飞船 / Spaceship</h3><div class=\"star-helm-model-pair\"><img class=\"\" src=\"/assets/star-helm-ship-front.webp\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" alt=\"星舵飞船正面模型\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><img class=\"\" src=\"/assets/star-helm-ship-side.webp\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" alt=\"星舵飞船侧面模型\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></div></div><div><h3>星币 / Star Coin</h3><div class=\"star-helm-model-pair star-helm-model-pair--coins\"><img class=\"\" src=\"/assets/star-helm-star-front.webp\" width=\"700\" height=\"700\" alt=\"星币正面模型\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><img class=\"\" src=\"/assets/star-helm-star-side.webp\" width=\"700\" height=\"648\" alt=\"星币侧面模型\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></div></div></div><div class=\"star-helm-assets\"><h3>三组主题障碍物</h3><figure class=\"star-helm-figure \"><img class=\"\" src=\"/assets/star-helm-assets-candy.webp\" width=\"2200\" height=\"644\" alt=\"糖果星球的障碍物三维资产\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption>糖果星球</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"star-helm-figure \"><img class=\"\" src=\"/assets/star-helm-assets-desert.webp\" width=\"2200\" height=\"451\" alt=\"沙之星球的障碍物三维资产\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption>沙之星球</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"star-helm-figure \"><img class=\"\" src=\"/assets/star-helm-assets-ocean.webp\" width=\"2200\" height=\"367\" alt=\"海之星球的障碍物三维资产\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption>海之星球</figcaption></figure></div></div></section><section class=\"star-helm-chapter ssc\" aria-labelledby=\"star-helm-section-7\" data-pdf-pages=\"14,15,16\"><div class=\"star-helm-inner\"><div class=\"star-helm-section-header mini_header\"><span class=\"header_nbr\">07/</span><span id=\"star-helm-section-7\">视觉语言与品牌规范</span></div><div class=\"star-helm-intro\"><h2>将航行的意象，<br>延伸为视觉语言。</h2><p>以船舵、飞船与星辰构成标志，将探索宇宙的概念贯穿色彩、字体和界面。青绿、暖橙与紫色形成带有科技趣味的视觉基调。</p></div><div class=\"star-helm-brand\"><div class=\"star-helm-logo-symbol\"><img class=\"\" src=\"/assets/star-helm-logo-symbol.webp\" width=\"372\" height=\"373\" alt=\"星舵船舵、飞船与星辰组合标志\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></div><div class=\"star-helm-wordmark\"><img class=\"\" src=\"/assets/star-helm-wordmark.webp\" width=\"1800\" height=\"379\" alt=\"星舵 Star Helm 标准字标\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><p>以手势为舵，驶向心中的星辰。</p></div></div><div class=\"star-helm-palette\" aria-label=\"星舵品牌色彩规范\"><div><span style=\"background:#28CEC2\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><strong>#28CEC2</strong><p>RGB 40 / 206 / 194</p></div><div><span style=\"background:#E8A74F\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><strong>#E8A74F</strong><p>RGB 232 / 167 / 79</p></div><div><span style=\"background:#9D7EE0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><strong>#9D7EE0</strong><p>RGB 157 / 126 / 224</p></div><div><span style=\"background:#EDFBEF\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><strong>#EDFBEF</strong><p>RGB 237 / 251 / 239</p></div></div><figure class=\"star-helm-figure star-helm-type\"><img class=\"\" src=\"/assets/star-helm-type-specimen.webp\" width=\"1800\" height=\"620\" alt=\"星舵中文、英文与 Logo 的原始字体设计样张\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption>字体设计 / 中文、英文与 Logo 标准字</figcaption></figure></div></section><section class=\"star-helm-chapter ssc\" aria-labelledby=\"star-helm-section-8\" data-pdf-pages=\"17\"><div class=\"star-helm-inner\"><div class=\"star-helm-section-header mini_header\"><span class=\"header_nbr\">08/</span><span id=\"star-helm-section-8\">UI 与交互界面</span></div><div class=\"star-helm-intro\"><h2>让界面服务于探索。</h2><p>以开始、选关和游戏状态提示衔接体验。沿用主题星球的视觉语言，通过清晰的图标、边框与反馈，引导玩家进入空间交互。</p></div><figure class=\"star-helm-figure \"><img class=\"\" src=\"/assets/star-helm-ui-start.webp?v=097b6f80eb69\" width=\"2400\" height=\"1500\" alt=\"星舵 Star Helm 开始主界面\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption>开始界面 / 主界面设计</figcaption></figure><div class=\"star-helm-ui-detail\"><figure class=\"star-helm-figure \"><img class=\"\" src=\"/assets/star-helm-ui-levels.webp\" width=\"1800\" height=\"1125\" alt=\"包含糖果星球、沙之星球和海之星球的选关界面\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption>选关界面 / 三颗星球</figcaption></figure><div><h3>轻界面，强空间</h3><p>在开始与选关阶段提供必要指引，进入关卡后以手势、空间位置和视觉反馈承接主要交互。</p><p>暂停、继续与终点图标帮助玩家识别当前状态，不同主题边框保持关卡的视觉连续性。</p></div></div><figure class=\"star-helm-figure \"><img class=\"\" src=\"/assets/star-helm-ui-components.webp\" width=\"2401\" height=\"432\" alt=\"暂停、终点、继续图标与三个主题星球的界面边框\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption>界面组件 / 操作图标与主题边框</figcaption></figure></div></section><section class=\"star-helm-chapter ssc\" aria-labelledby=\"star-helm-section-9\" data-pdf-pages=\"20,21,22,23,24,27,28\"><div class=\"star-helm-inner\"><div class=\"star-helm-section-header mini_header\"><span class=\"header_nbr\">09/</span><span id=\"star-helm-section-9\">技术实现与空间体验</span></div><div class=\"star-helm-intro\"><h2>从手势识别，<br>到真实空间中的飞行。</h2><p>使用 Unity 2022.3 LTS 与 Rokid UXR SDK，将手部追踪、多星球引力和空间适配整合为可体验的 AR 原型。Blender、Kiro 与 Hyper3D 分别支持资产制作、代码协作和辅助模型生成。</p></div><div class=\"star-helm-grid star-helm-grid--three star-helm-systems\"><article><figure class=\"star-helm-figure \"><img class=\"\" src=\"/assets/star-helm-gesture-system.webp\" width=\"1400\" height=\"718\" alt=\"Unity 中的星球与手部追踪调试画面\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></figure><h3>手势交互系统</h3><p>追踪 Palm、Wrist、IndexTip 等手部关键节点的位置与方向，将托举与捏合动作映射为飞船控制和力场生成。</p></article><article><figure class=\"star-helm-figure \"><img class=\"\" src=\"/assets/star-helm-gravity-system.webp\" width=\"1400\" height=\"738\" alt=\"飞船在星球引力作用下的轨迹调试画面\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></figure><h3>多星球引力系统</h3><p>让多个引力源共同作用于飞船。通过距离阈值切换环绕轨道，并调节切向速度，保持飞行的平滑性。</p></article><article><figure class=\"star-helm-figure \"><img class=\"\" src=\"/assets/star-helm-ar-play.webp\" width=\"1353\" height=\"763\" alt=\"真实场地中叠加星舵虚拟关卡的体验画面\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></figure><h3>AR 空间适配</h3><p>依托 OpenXR 的空间追踪与 XR Origin 校准，将虚拟关卡稳定地放置在现实环境中。</p></article></div><figure class=\"star-helm-figure \"><img class=\"\" src=\"/assets/star-helm-ar-room.webp\" width=\"1800\" height=\"1014\" alt=\"玩家在真实室内空间体验星舵 AR 关卡\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption>空间体验 / 走进关卡，观察并调整航线</figcaption></figure><div class=\"star-helm-setting\"><h3>为身体的移动留出空间</h3><p>项目面向初次接触 AR、喜欢空间探索与趣味互动的玩家。体验设计以 3 m × 5 m 以上的开阔空间为基础，让玩家能够围绕飞船移动，从不同角度观察和规划路线。</p></div></div></section><div class=\"footer ssc\"><div class=\"footer_c\"><div class=\"footer_sen\"></div><nav class=\"footer_nav\"> <ul class=\"footer_nav_items\"></ul></nav></div></div><div class=\"footer--touch ssc\"> <nav class=\"footer_nav--touch\"><ul class=\"footer_nav_items--touch\"> </ul></nav></div><div class=\"projects_project_ref\"></div></div>","meta":"星舵 Star Helm"},"/the-fantastic-bowl":{"html":"<div class=\"project multimedia-project\"><div class=\"project_drag_cs\"><div class=\"project_cf\"></div><canvas class=\"project_drag_cs_cvs circAn\"></