roject_hero_title\"><h1><span>艺术与科技双年展</span></h1></div><div class=\"project_hero_img\"><div class=\"project_hero_line\"></div><div class=\"project_hero_header\"><div class=\"project_hero_header_specs\"><span class=\"project_hero_header_rv\">VISUAL DESIGN</span></div></div></div></div><div class=\"project_row ssc\"><div class=\"project_row_hero_media biennale-visual-media\"><video class=\"biennale-logo-video\" src=\"/assets/biennale-logo-animation.mp4\" width=\"3072\" height=\"1024\" autoplay muted loop playsinline webkit-playsinline preload=\"auto\" aria-label=\"艺术与科技双年展标志动态设计\"></video></div></div><section class=\"biennale-introduction ssc\" aria-labelledby=\"biennale-introduction-title\"><h2 class=\"biennale-introduction-title\" id=\"biennale-introduction-title\">天地人机——中国（杭州）艺术与科技国际双年展</h2><p class=\"biennale-introduction-body\">作为第三届“良渚论坛”期间举办的国际文化艺术交流活动，展览汇聚来自全球20余个国家和地区、160余位（组）艺术家、科学家等创造者创作的作品，通过主题展览与文明对话深化交流互鉴，呈现技术迭代进程中文化生态的重构轨迹和未来图景，展示浙江践行文化建设“八项工程”20年来，在数字文化、艺术科技融合领域的创新成果，回应“文明重光：文化遗产与人类文化多样性”的主题。</p></section><div class=\"project_row ssc\"><div class=\"project_row_hero_media biennale-visual-media\"><img class=\"biennale-visual-image\" src=\"/assets/biennale-visual-04.jpg\" alt=\"艺术与科技双年展海报设计\" width=\"3840\" height=\"2160\"></div></div><div class=\"project_row ssc\"><div class=\"project_row_hero_media biennale-visual-media\"><img class=\"biennale-visual-image\" src=\"/assets/biennale-visual-05.jpg\" alt=\"艺术与科技双年展各校区视觉设计\" width=\"3840\" height=\"2160\"></div></div><div class=\"project_row ssc\"><div class=\"project_row_hero_media biennale-visual-media\"><img class=\"biennale-visual-image\" src=\"/assets/biennale-visual-06.jpg\" alt=\"艺术与科技双年展舞台视觉设计\" width=\"3840\" height=\"2160\"></div></div><div class=\"project_row ssc\"><div class=\"project_row_hero_media biennale-visual-media\"><img class=\"biennale-visual-image\" src=\"/assets/biennale-visual-12.jpg\" alt=\"艺术与科技双年展桥面视觉设计\" width=\"3840\" height=\"2160\"></div></div><div class=\"project_row ssc\"><div class=\"project_row_hero_media biennale-visual-media\"><img class=\"biennale-visual-image\" src=\"/assets/biennale-visual-14.jpg\" alt=\"艺术与科技双年展展签及导视设计\" width=\"3840\" height=\"2160\"></div></div><div class=\"footer ssc\"><div class=\"footer_c\"><div class=\"footer_sen\"></div><nav class=\"footer_nav\"> <ul class=\"footer_nav_items\"></ul></nav></div></div><div class=\"footer--touch ssc\"> <nav class=\"footer_nav--touch\"><ul class=\"footer_nav_items--touch\"> </ul></nav></div><div class=\"projects_project_ref\"></div></div>","meta":"艺术与科技双年展"},"/vistria":{"html":"<div class=\"project framia-project\"><div class=\"project_drag_cs\"><div class=\"project_cf\"></div><canvas class=\"project_drag_cs_cvs circAn\"></canvas><div class=\"project_drag_cs_trl\"><svg width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 16\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M8.5 1.5L2 8L8.5 14.5\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"2\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"project_drag_cs_trd\"><svg width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 16\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M1.5 1.5L8 8L1.5 14.5\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"2\"></path></svg></div></div><div class=\"project_hero ssc\"><div class=\"project_hero_title\"><h1><span>Framia</span></h1></div><div class=\"project_hero_img\"> <div class=\"project_hero_line\"></div><div class=\"project_hero_header mini_header\"> <div class=\"project_hero_header_section_nbr\"> <span class=\"project_hero_header_rv header_nbr\">01/</span></div><div class=\"project_hero_header_specs\"> <span class=\"project_hero_header_rv\">WEB DESIGN</span></div></div><div class=\"img_overlay\"></div><img class=\"project_hero_img_media project_gl lazy\" data-lazy src=\"/blank.png\" data-touch=\"/assets/framia-canvas.png?v=5e0d0ecd0828\" data-src=\"/assets/framia-canvas.png?v=5e0d0ecd0828\" alt=\"Framia creative studio canvas\" width=\"1440\" height=\"1761\"></div><div class=\"project_hero_description\"> <h2>Turn<br>Inspirations<br>into<br>Masterpieces</h2></div><div class=\"project_hero_roles_title\"> <span>SKILLS USED</span></div><div class=\"project_hero_roles\"> <p class=\"project_hero_roles_p\">Art Direction<br>Product Design<br>System Design<br>Interactive Design</p></div></div><div class=\"project_description ssc\"><div class=\"project_description_header mini_header\"><div class=\"project_description_header_section_nbr project_description_header_ov header_nbr\"><span class=\"project_description_header_rv\">02/</span></div><div class=\"project_description_header_title project_description_header_ov\"><span class=\"project_description_header_rv\">overview</span></div></div><div class=\"project_description_line\"></div><div class=\"home_about_glLineP\"> <div class=\"glLineP\"></div></div><div class=\"project_description_challenge\"><div class=\"project_description_challenge_title\"><h3><span class=\"project_description_title_rv\">项目介绍</span></h3></div><div class=\"project_description_challenge_d\"><p>此项目记录我在 Framia 工作期间所负责的UI/X设计，涵盖首页升级改版、Agent Node节点体验链路优化，以及AssetLibrary资产库的全链路设计与搭建，同时承担日常运营视觉素材的设计与产出等等。</p></div></div></div><div class=\"project_row ssc\"><div class=\"project_row_header mini_header\"> <div class=\"home_about_glLineP\"> <div class=\"glLineP\"></div></div><div class=\"project_row_header_section_nbr header_nbr\">02/</div><div class=\"project_row_header_title\">THE EXPERT NODE</div></div></div><div class=\"project_row ssc\"><div class=\"project_row_inBetween_text\"> <p class=\"project_row_inBetween_tile\">THE EXPERT NODE</p><p class=\"project_row_inBetween_description\" lang=\"zh-CN\">将能力表达模糊的 Agent Node 升级为角色清晰、技能预设的 Expert Node，把趋势研究、视频拆解、脚本规划与创意评审等专业环节融入画布</p></div></div><div class=\"project_row ssc\"><div class=\"project_row_hero_media framia-expert-demo\"><video class=\"framia-expert-demo-video\" src=\"/assets/framia-expert-node-demo.mp4?v=609f5dc81d3a\" width=\"1902\" height=\"966\" autoplay muted loop playsinline webkit-playsinline preload=\"metadata\" controlslist=\"nofullscreen nodownload noremoteplayback\" disablepictureinpicture disableremoteplayback aria-label=\"Framia Expert Node 演示视频\"></video></div></div><div class=\"project_row ssc\"><div class=\"project_row_mobile_scroll project_row_stick\"><div class=\"project_mobile_scroll_text sticky_text\"><div class=\"project_mobile_scroll_text_description framia-expert-description\" lang=\"zh-CN\"><p>我设计了 Expert Node 从选择、配置到执行与结果回流的完整流程，以预设技能支持研究、脚本创作、提示词优化和评审</p><p>用户只需按任务选择专业角色，即可在统一交互中完成创作，无需重复学习</p></div></div><div class=\"project_mobile_scroll_medias framia-node-gallery\"><img src=\"/assets/framia-expert-node-1.png?v=da0f1e3f6f4b\" alt=\"Framia Video Recreator workflow\" width=\"1440\" height=\"815\" decoding=\"async\"><img src=\"/assets/framia-expert-node-2.png?v=31825039006b\" alt=\"Framia Script and storyboard creator workflow\" width=\"1440\" height=\"815\" decoding=\"async\"><img src=\"/assets/framia-expert-node-3.png?v=b21e8f8a554d\" alt=\"Framia Prompt Refiner workflow\" width=\"1440\" height=\"815\" decoding=\"async\"><img src=\"/assets/framia-expert-node-4.png?v=b05b0c0bd684\" alt=\"Framia Trend Researcher workflow\" width=\"1440\" height=\"815\" decoding=\"async\"><img src=\"/assets/framia-expert-node-5.png?v=7eb81ebc31aa\" alt=\"Framia General Expert settings workflow\" width=\"1440\" height=\"815\" decoding=\"async\"><img src=\"/assets/framia-expert-node-6.png?v=84d85480fe8a\" alt=\"Framia Creative Reviewer workflow\" width=\"1440\" height=\"815\" decoding=\"async\"></div></div></div><div class=\"project_row ssc\"><div class=\"project_row_slideshow framia-video-slideshow\"><div class=\"project_row_slideshow_media\"><video data-webgl-video src=\"/assets/framia-what-is.mp4\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\" muted autoplay loop playsinline preload=\"auto\" disablepictureinpicture disableremoteplayback controlslist=\"nofullscreen nodownload noremoteplayback\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-label=\"What is Framia\"></video></div><div class=\"project_row_slideshow_media\"><video data-webgl-video src=\"/assets/framia-brandkit-to-any.mp4\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\" muted autoplay loop playsinline preload=\"auto\" disablepictureinpicture disableremoteplayback controlslist=\"nofullscreen nodownload noremoteplayback\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-label=\"Framia Brand Kit\"></video></div><div class=\"project_row_slideshow_media\"><video data-webgl-video src=\"/assets/framia-seedance.mp4\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\" muted autoplay loop playsinline preload=\"auto\" disablepictureinpicture disableremoteplayback controlslist=\"nofullscreen nodownload noremoteplayback\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-label=\"Framia Seedance\"></video></div><div class=\"project_row_slideshow_media\"><video data-webgl-video src=\"/assets/framia-ai-avatar.mp4\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\" muted autoplay loop playsinline preload=\"auto\" disablepictureinpicture disableremoteplayback controlslist=\"nofullscreen nodownload noremoteplayback\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-label=\"Framia AI Avatar\"></video></div></div></div><div class=\"project_row ssc\"><div class=\"project_row_header mini_header\"> <div class=\"home_about_glLineP\"> <div class=\"glLineP\"></div></div><div class=\"project_row_header_section_nbr header_nbr\">03/</div><div class=\"project_row_header_title\">ASSET LIBRARY</div></div></div><div class=\"project_row ssc\"><div class=\"project_row_inBetween_text framia-asset-library\" lang=\"zh-CN\"> <p class=\"project_row_inBetween_tile\">Framia 资产库</p><div class=\"project_row_inBetween_description\"><p>将分散在项目与画布中的素材统一管理，覆盖上传导入、文件夹管理、检索预览，以及画布与 Agent Chat 中的调用和回存。</p></div></div></div><div class=\"project_row ssc\"><div class=\"project_row_hero_media framia-asset-library-media\"><img src=\"/assets/framia-asset-library.png\" width=\"1440\" height=\"954\" alt=\"Framia 资产库界面\" decoding=\"async\"></div></div><section class=\"framia-asset-journey framia-asset-stage ssc\" aria-labelledby=\"framia-asset-stage-1\" data-source-step=\"1\"><div class=\"framia-asset-stage-heading\"><span class=\"framia-asset-stage-number\">01</span><h3 id=\"framia-asset-stage-1\">初次进入 · 空状态</h3><p>通过空状态说明资产库的用途，保留添加资产与创建文件夹入口，帮助用户开始建立自己的素材库。</p></div><div class=\"framia-asset-stage-gallery framia-asset-stage-gallery--single\"><figure class=\"framia-asset-state\" data-source-frame=\"18\"><img src=\"/assets/framia-asset-01-empty-01.webp\" width=\"1440\" height=\"954\" alt=\"初次进入 · 空状态：首次进入资产库\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption>首次进入资产库</figcaption></figure></div></section>\n<section class=\"framia-asset-journey framia-asset-stage ssc\" aria-labelledby=\"framia-asset-stage-2\" data-source-step=\"2\"><div class=\"framia-asset-stage-heading\"><span class=\"framia-asset-stage-number\">02</span><h3 id=\"framia-asset-stage-2\">本地上传</h3><p>从 Add 入口上传本地文件，明确呈现拖拽、上传进度与失败反馈，并支持选择或新建保存文件夹。</p></div><div class=\"framia-asset-stage-gallery\"><figure class=\"framia-asset-state\" data-source-frame=\"19\"><img src=\"/assets/framia-asset-02-upload-01.webp\" width=\"1440\" height=\"954\" alt=\"本地上传：选择本地上传入口\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption>选择本地上传入口</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"framia-asset-state\" data-source-frame=\"21\"><img src=\"/assets/framia-asset-02-upload-02.webp\" width=\"1440\" height=\"954\" alt=\"本地上传：上传弹窗与保存位置\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption>上传弹窗与保存位置</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"framia-asset-state\" data-source-frame=\"22\"><img src=\"/assets/framia-asset-02-upload-03.webp\" width=\"1440\" height=\"954\" alt=\"本地上传：拖拽、上传中与失败状态\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption>拖拽、上传中与失败状态</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"framia-asset-state\" data-source-frame=\"20\"><img src=\"/assets/framia-asset-02-upload-04.webp\" width=\"1440\" height=\"954\" alt=\"本地上传：选择已有文件夹或新建文件夹\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption>选择已有文件夹或新建文件夹</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"framia-asset-state\" data-source-frame=\"41\"><img src=\"/assets/framia-asset-02-upload-05.webp\" width=\"1440\" height=\"954\" alt=\"本地上传：上传完成后的资产列表\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption>上传完成后的资产列表</figcaption></figure></div></section>\n<section class=\"framia-asset-journey framia-asset-stage ssc\" aria-labelledby=\"framia-asset-stage-3\" data-source-step=\"3\"><div class=\"framia-asset-stage-heading\"><span class=\"framia-asset-stage-number\">03</span><h3 id=\"framia-asset-stage-3\">跨项目导入</h3><p>复用已有项目中的创作素材。按项目与文件类型查找，选中后确认导入当前资产库。</p></div><div class=\"framia-asset-stage-gallery\"><figure class=\"framia-asset-state\" data-source-frame=\"23\"><img src=\"/assets/framia-asset-03-cross-project-01.webp\" width=\"1440\" height=\"954\" alt=\"跨项目导入：从项目选择资产入口\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption>从项目选择资产入口</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"framia-asset-state\" data-source-frame=\"24\"><img src=\"/assets/framia-asset-03-cross-project-02.webp\" width=\"1440\" height=\"954\" alt=\"跨项目导入：按项目和类型选择素材\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption>按项目和类型选择素材</figcaption></figure></div></section>\n<section class=\"framia-asset-journey framia-asset-stage ssc\" aria-labelledby=\"framia-asset-stage-4\" data-source-step=\"4\"><div class=\"framia-asset-stage-heading\"><span class=\"framia-asset-stage-number\">04</span><h3 id=\"framia-asset-stage-4\">创建文件夹</h3><p>创建文件夹组织素材，完成命名后在资产库中展示，作为后续上传和归档的保存位置。</p></div><div class=\"framia-asset-stage-gallery\"><figure class=\"framia-asset-state\" data-source-frame=\"25\"><img src=\"/assets/framia-asset-04-folder-01.webp\" width=\"1440\" height=\"954\" alt=\"创建文件夹：创建文件夹入口\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption>创建文件夹入口</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"framia-asset-state\" data-source-frame=\"40\"><img src=\"/assets/framia-asset-04-folder-02.webp\" width=\"1440\" height=\"954\" alt=\"创建文件夹：输入文件夹名称\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption>输入文件夹名称</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"framia-asset-state\" data-source-frame=\"26\"><img src=\"/assets/framia-asset-04-folder-03.webp\" width=\"1440\" height=\"954\" alt=\"创建文件夹：创建完成与名称展示\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption>创建完成与名称展示</figcaption></figure></div></section>\n<section class=\"framia-asset-journey framia-asset-stage ssc\" aria-labelledby=\"framia-asset-stage-5\" data-source-step=\"5\"><div class=\"framia-asset-stage-heading\"><span class=\"framia-asset-stage-number\">05</span><h3 id=\"framia-asset-stage-5\">资产浏览</h3><p>统一展示图片、视频、音频与文件，提供网格和列表两种浏览方式，兼顾视觉查找与信息查看。</p></div><div class=\"framia-asset-stage-gallery\"><figure class=\"framia-asset-state\" data-source-frame=\"27\"><img src=\"/assets/framia-asset-05-browse-01.webp\" width=\"1440\" height=\"954\" alt=\"资产浏览：网格视图\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption>网格视图</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"framia-asset-state\" data-source-frame=\"39\"><img src=\"/assets/framia-asset-05-browse-02.webp\" width=\"1440\" height=\"954\" alt=\"资产浏览：列表视图\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption>列表视图</figcaption></figure></div></section>\n<section class=\"framia-asset-journey framia-asset-stage ssc\" aria-labelledby=\"framia-asset-stage-6\" data-source-step=\"6\"><div class=\"framia-asset-stage-heading\"><span class=\"framia-asset-stage-number\">06</span><h3 id=\"framia-asset-stage-6\">批量操作</h3><p>选中多个资产后集中呈现操作栏，支持发送到画布、创建文件夹、下载与删除，并展示新建画布的确认流程。</p></div><div class=\"framia-asset-stage-gallery\"><figure class=\"framia-asset-state\" data-source-frame=\"36\"><img src=\"/assets/framia-asset-06-batch-01.webp\" width=\"1440\" height=\"954\" alt=\"批量操作：批量选择与底部操作栏\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption>批量选择与底部操作栏</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"framia-asset-state\" data-source-frame=\"37\"><img src=\"/assets/framia-asset-06-batch-02.webp\" width=\"1440\" height=\"954\" alt=\"批量操作：发送到新画布的确认弹窗\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption>发送到新画布的确认弹窗</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"framia-asset-state\" data-source-frame=\"38\"><img src=\"/assets/framia-asset-06-batch-03.webp\" width=\"1440\" height=\"954\" alt=\"批量操作：新建画布 · 确认状态\" loading=\"